{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","id":"137f9505f73ced0d0f6a663a","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo%40oss.qualcomm.com/","channels":["linux-arm-msm","linux-devicetree"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo%40oss.qualcomm.com/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"},"subject":"[PATCH 0/2] arm64: dts: qcom: Use hyphen in rpmhpd OPP node names","messages":{"20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com":{"id":"20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","messageId":"20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","references":[],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Shawn Guo","address":"shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Bjorn Andersson","address":"andersson@kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"Konrad Dybcio","address":"konradybcio@kernel.org"},{"name":"Rob Herring","address":"robh@kernel.org"},{"name":"Krzysztof Kozlowski","address":"krzk+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Conor Dooley","address":"conor+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"devicetree@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"Shawn Guo","address":"shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-16T12:36:46.000Z","iso":"2026-08-16T12:36:46.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"[PATCH 0/2] arm64: dts: qcom: Use hyphen in rpmhpd OPP node names","mailingLists":[{"id":"devicetree.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"devicetree.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The rpmhpd OPP tables on kodiak and lemans have some OPP nodes named\noppN rather than opp-N.  On lemans this is inconsistent within the very\nsame table, which starts with opp-0 and opp-1, then has opp2 and opp3,\nand goes back to opp-4 and onwards.  On kodiak the whole table uses the\noppN form, which is inconsistent with the rest of the qcom DTS files and\nwith DTS coding style."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Rename the nodes to the opp-N form, keeping the existing numbering.  The\nchange should be safe, because node names are not considered an ABI and\nall references to these nodes go through labels."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Shawn Guo (2):\n  arm64: dts: qcom: kodiak: Use hyphen in rpmhpd OPP node names\n  arm64: dts: qcom: lemans: Use hyphen in rpmhpd OPP node names"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":" arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kodiak.dtsi | 18 +++++++++---------\n arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/lemans.dtsi |  4 ++--\n 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)"},{"kind":"signature","text":"2.43.0","lineCount":1}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[]},"20260816123648.1632681-2-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com":{"id":"20260816123648.1632681-2-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","messageId":"20260816123648.1632681-2-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","references":["20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Shawn Guo","address":"shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Bjorn Andersson","address":"andersson@kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"Konrad Dybcio","address":"konradybcio@kernel.org"},{"name":"Rob Herring","address":"robh@kernel.org"},{"name":"Krzysztof Kozlowski","address":"krzk+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Conor Dooley","address":"conor+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"devicetree@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"Shawn Guo","address":"shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-16T12:36:47.000Z","iso":"2026-08-16T12:36:47.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"[PATCH 1/2] arm64: dts: qcom: kodiak: Use hyphen in rpmhpd OPP node names","mailingLists":[{"id":"devicetree.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"devicetree.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The OPP nodes in the rpmhpd OPP table are named oppN, while DTS coding\nstyle and the rest of the qcom DTS files use the opp-N form.  Rename\nthem for consistency.  Change should be safe, because node names are not\nconsidered an ABI, and all references go through labels."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Signed-off-by: Shawn Guo <shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com>"},{"kind":"patch","patchId":"patch:20260816123648.1632681-2-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com:1:0"}],"patchIds":["patch:20260816123648.1632681-2-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com:1:0"],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":1,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","parentId":"20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"},"20260816123648.1632681-3-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com":{"id":"20260816123648.1632681-3-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","messageId":"20260816123648.1632681-3-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","references":["20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Shawn Guo","address":"shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Bjorn Andersson","address":"andersson@kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"Konrad Dybcio","address":"konradybcio@kernel.org"},{"name":"Rob Herring","address":"robh@kernel.org"},{"name":"Krzysztof Kozlowski","address":"krzk+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"Conor Dooley","address":"conor+dt@kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"devicetree@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"Shawn Guo","address":"shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-16T12:36:48.000Z","iso":"2026-08-16T12:36:48.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"[PATCH 2/2] arm64: dts: qcom: lemans: Use hyphen in rpmhpd OPP node names","mailingLists":[{"id":"devicetree.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"devicetree.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Two OPP nodes in the rpmhpd OPP table are named opp2 and opp3, while the\nsurrounding nodes in the same table use the opp-N form.  Rename them for\nconsistency.  Change should be safe, because node names are not\nconsidered an ABI, and all references go through labels."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Signed-off-by: Shawn Guo <shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com>"},{"kind":"patch","patchId":"patch:20260816123648.1632681-3-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com:2:0"}],"patchIds":["patch:20260816123648.1632681-3-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com:2:0"],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":2,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","parentId":"20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"}},"rootIds":["20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"],"childrenByParent":{"20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com":["20260816123648.1632681-2-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","20260816123648.1632681-3-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"]},"chronologicalIds":["20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","20260816123648.1632681-2-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","20260816123648.1632681-3-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com"],"patchSeries":[{"id":"1:arm64: dts: qcom: use hyphen in rpmhpd opp node names","version":1,"total":2,"subjectStem":"arm64: dts: qcom: Use hyphen in rpmhpd OPP node names","coverMessageId":"20260816123648.1632681-1-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","members":[{"index":1,"messageId":"20260816123648.1632681-2-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","patchId":"patch:20260816123648.1632681-2-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com:1:0"},{"index":2,"messageId":"20260816123648.1632681-3-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com","patchId":"patch:20260816123648.1632681-3-shengchao.guo@oss.qualcomm.com:2:0"}],"incomplete":false}],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{"patch:202608161236